        "@media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {.shopify-hardcoded-text-section-wrapper {min-height: 200px; padding: 16px !important; }}"
      ],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Here is what nobody tells you about first impressions: the one that sticks usually<br/>happens in the first thirty seconds, before you have found the table or figured out where to put your jacket. Scent is doing that work. It is the part of the introduction the other person processes without realizing it, which is exactly why it matters more than most people account for when they are getting ready.</p><p><br/>A first date looks like a lot of different things. A reservation at a place you have been trying to get into for months. A rooftop bar where the view does some of the heavy lifting. A low-key cocktail spot that feels relaxed enough to not be pressure but good enough to show you made an effort. Whatever the setting, the right fragrance carries through all of it, from the Uber ride over to the end of the night. </p><p>These are the Scentspired bestsellers worth wearing. Three for women, three for men. No filler.</p>"
      }
    },
