      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Wrists, neck, inside of the elbow. Pulse points generate heat, and heat is what keeps a fragrance developing through the evening. Apply before you leave, give it a few minutes to settle into your skin, and leave it alone. One or two sprays are the right call. Any more and the scent becomes the whole personality. That is not the goal tonight.</p>"
