    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1200,
            "section_padding": 20,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "heading": "<p>The one that says you have done this before: Timeless Grace (inspired by Coco Mademoiselle by Chanel)</p>",
            "heading_size": 56,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 10,
            "box_color": "#8b1d22",
            "box_radius": 25,
            "box_padding": 40,
            "box_spacing": 10,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>Coco Mademoiselle has been the first-date fragrance of choice for a long time, and the reason is not complicated: it works. Timeless Grace brings the same energy. Orange and bergamot open into jasmine and rose, settling into a warm patchouli base that gets better as the evening goes on. A <a href=\"/collections/women\" title=\"Women\">luxury perfume for women</a> that reads as confident without being loud, polished without being stiff. </p><p>This is the kind of scent that stays with someone after you say goodnight. Which is, if we are being direct about it, the entire point.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "box_text_size": 22,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "paragraph_spacing": 25,
            "subheading": "<p>The one that earns a follow-up text: Fate (inspired by Chance EDP by Chanel)</p>",
            "subheading_size": 56,
            "subheading_color": "#000000",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>Chanel named this one well. Pink pepper and jasmine open over white musk and<br/>amber, light enough that it does not take over the room, warm enough to last through dinner and whatever the night turns into after. One of the best perfumes for women who want something that works across every part of the evening without having to think about it. </p><p>Fresh, warm, and a little bit lucky. Which is a good thing to smell like on a first date.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 22,
            "bottom_text_color": "#000000",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.6
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
    "blocks_H7kNPg": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_6LpzGP": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1200,
            "section_padding": 20,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "heading": "",
            "heading_size": 56,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 10,
            "box_color": "#8b1d22",
            "box_radius": 25,
            "box_padding": 40,
            "box_spacing": 10,
            "box_paragraph_1": "",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "box_text_size": 22,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "paragraph_spacing": 25,
            "subheading": "<p>The one that gets noticed at the right moment: Pink Whisper (inspired by Delina by Parfums de Marly)</p>",
            "subheading_size": 56,
            "subheading_color": "#000000",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>Delina built one of the most loyal followings in niche fragrance because it smells like the version of yourself you want to show up as when it counts. Pink Whisper delivers the same rose and lychee opening over a vanilla and musk base that stays close to the skin. Feminine without being obvious about it. A <a href=\"/collections/women\" title=\"Women\">top women's perfume</a> that does not announce itself across the room but gets noticed by the right person at exactly the right distance.</p><p><br/>That is the whole point of a great first date fragrance. And this one nails it.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 22,
            "bottom_text_color": "#000000",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.6
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
